  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 6.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like. Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.58,
      "text": "yeah, it's an itchy patch on my wrist i don't know what's causing it i'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.39,
      "end_seconds": 28.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.84,
      "end_seconds": 33.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Probably about three months. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.59,
      "end_seconds": 42.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.64,
      "end_seconds": 53.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "yes, my new watch strap. That makes it worse. It's moderate, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.02,
      "end_seconds": 58.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.19,
      "end_seconds": 77.68,
      "duration_seconds": 18.49,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get dry flaky skin as well. The dry flaky skin? That's been for six months. About dry flaky skin, maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.3,
      "end_seconds": 82.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.67,
      "end_seconds": 91.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.82,
      "end_seconds": 118.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.9, respiratory rate 15, BP is 110 over 68, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.26,
      "end_seconds": 121.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.45,
      "end_seconds": 125.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.08,
      "end_seconds": 145.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Right, did you get fever, spreading or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.97,
      "end_seconds": 151.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.53,
      "end_seconds": 154.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.37,
      "end_seconds": 157.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.32,
      "end_seconds": 162.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.9,
      "end_seconds": 166.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.64,
      "end_seconds": 169.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.03,
      "end_seconds": 174.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.62,
      "end_seconds": 182.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.97,
      "end_seconds": 188.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.21,
      "end_seconds": 192.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Okay, do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.39,
      "end_seconds": 198.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.2,
      "end_seconds": 203.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "alright, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.05,
      "end_seconds": 207.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.52,
      "end_seconds": 221.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.65,
      "end_seconds": 228.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.13,
      "end_seconds": 246.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.52,
      "end_seconds": 252.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I take a plain moisturiser, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.61,
      "end_seconds": 274.58,
      "duration_seconds": 19.97,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I don't have a clear answer today: mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap is possible, and so is eczema. The treatment will be hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. It's for contact dermatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.81,
      "end_seconds": 277.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.98,
      "end_seconds": 290.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "Stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.01,
      "end_seconds": 297.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Mm, okay. If it spreads or blisters, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.02,
      "end_seconds": 299.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.91,
      "end_seconds": 306.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "let me check I've been clear what will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.09,
      "end_seconds": 317.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "So, I take the hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.6,
      "end_seconds": 322.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.9,
      "end_seconds": 327.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
